ration, such quantities of wheat and wheat-flour \nand at such prices as are necessary to exercise the rights, obtain the \nbenefits, achieve the objectives, and fulfill the obligations of the United \nStates under the International Wheat Agreement.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"28 FR 5185, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 1(a)","sha256":"eb9bd9c3f6e4474c7a5517477d521388f510fcd49e995499dc70f9cfffebc8ef","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1963-05-24/pdf/FR-1963-05-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11108#sec1(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) Prohibit or restrict the importation or exportation of wheat \nor wheat-flour and issue such rules and regulations as he may deem \nnecessary in the implementation of the International Wheat \nAgreement.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"28 FR 5185, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 1(b)","sha256":"eb9bd9c3f6e4474c7a5517477d521388f510fcd49e995499dc70f9cfffebc8ef","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1963-05-24/pdf/FR-1963-05-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11108#sec1(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) Require, in accordance with such regulations as he may pre- \n*  scribie, the making of such reports and the keeping of such records as \nhe finds necessary to enable him to carry out the purposes of the Act.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"28 FR 5185, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 1(c)","sha256":"eb9bd9c3f6e4474c7a5517477d521388f510fcd49e995499dc70f9cfffebc8ef","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1963-05-24/pdf/FR-1963-05-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11108#sec1(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(d) Examine such books, papers, records, accounts, correspondence, \ncontracts, documents, and memoranda as are relevent to transactions \nunder the International Wheat Agreement and are within the control \nof any person required to make reports or keep records under such \nregulations.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"28 FR 5185, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 1(d)","sha256":"eb9bd9c3f6e4474c7a5517477d521388f510fcd49e995499dc70f9cfffebc8ef","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1963-05-24/pdf/FR-1963-05-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11108#sec1(d)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(e) Take such other action as may be necessary in his judgment in \nthe implementation of the International Wheat Agreement.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"28 FR 5185, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 1(e)","sha256":"eb9bd9c3f6e4474c7a5517477d521388f510fcd49e995499dc70f9cfffebc8ef","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1963-05-24/pdf/FR-1963-05-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11108#sec1(e)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S ec. 2. Interagency Cooperation. The Secretary, in exercising the \nauthority delegated herein, shall consult with the Secretary of State, \nthe Special Representative for Trade Negotiations, and other officers \nor agencies of the Government as may be appropriate.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"28 FR 5185, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 2","sha256":"eb9bd9c3f6e4474c7a5517477d521388f510fcd49e995499dc70f9cfffebc8ef","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1963-05-24/pdf/FR-1963-05-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11108#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S ec. 3. Redelegation. The Secretary is hereby authorized to redele­\ngate within the Department of Agriculture the authority hereinabove \ndelegated to him.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"28 FR 5185, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 3","sha256":"eb9bd9c3f6e4474c7a5517477d521388f510fcd49e995499dc70f9cfffebc8ef","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1963-05-24/pdf/FR-1963-05-24.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11108#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"28 FR 5185, PDF pages 3-3","sha256":"eb9bd9c3f6e4474c7a5517477d521388f510fcd49e995499dc70f9cfffebc8ef","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1963-05-24/pdf/FR-1963-05-24.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 8 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: whole-order ending not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"no"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:11108"}
